    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've died, this is space hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone gets room and board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doesn't seem so <strong>bad</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WARNING: Extremely &quot;nuanced&quot; driving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's clearly not for everyone, but I and at least five (5!) other humans really enjoy it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gamepad is strongly recommended!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about cute girls and speedy cars! Race <strong>THE TRACKS OF THE ABYSS</strong>, socialize with online strangers (or friends), furnish your apartment and explore the new much improved hell city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Drive around in rocket cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Become the TOP-STAR-RACER.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Go furniture shopping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Decorate your own apartment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ragdoll around on the floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Seamless drop-in drop-out multiplayer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489120/extras/8e2da42254c7b38a541f6926d054434f.poster.avif?t=1727005310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489120/extras/8e2da42254c7b38a541f6926d054434f.webm?t=1727005310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489120/extras/8e2da42254c7b38a541f6926d054434f.mp4?t=1727005310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Connection is automatic, but you can manually select region and overflow if you're lo